{# Expected: 10 warnings, 0 errors (TranslationPluralMissingFormat) — one per FAIL case #}
{# Note: every case sits in an `aria-label` attribute so TranslationMissingTypography (which watches visible text nodes) stays silent and the run emits exactly 10 — only this rule's warnings. The placement is a test-isolation device, not a claim that plurals belong in attributes. If a future rule fires on a line here, fix the case, don't relax this rule. #}

{# === FAIL 1: _nx with %s and no |format — the shape measured on every Drupal call site === #}
