{# === FAIL 18: {% set %} now, |format later. A KNOWN false positive, pinned so it stays visible rather than being rediscovered: the rule has no cross-expression data flow, and the stored value may never be formatted at all. Silence with a Layer-A comment (§ 3) naming this case. === #}
{% set plural_label = _n('%s set', '%s sets', count, 'tailwind-base') %}
<div aria-label="{{ plural_label|format(count) }}"></div>

